- Darak gap: I / You / We / They + V1 (fe''lning asosiy shakli); He / She / It + V1 + -s / -es (masalan: He plays, She watches).
- Inkor gap: I / You / We / They + do not (don''t) + V1; He / She / It + does not (doesn''t) + V1.
- So''roq gap: Do + I / you / we / they + V1? Does + he / she / it + V1?
Vaqt ko''rsatkichlari (Frequency adverbs): always (doimo), usually (odatda), often (tez-tez), sometimes (ba''zan), never (hech qachon), every day/week (har kuni/hafta). Odatda fe''ldan oldin keladi: ''I always wake up at 7 AM''. ''To be'' fe''lidan keyin keladi: ''She is always happy''.', '[{"title": "3-shaxs birlikda fe''l o''zgarishi", "problem": "''He (go) to school by bus every morning'' gapini to''g''ri shaklga keltiring.", "step_by_step": "Ega ''He'' (3-shaxs birlik) bo''lgani uchun ''go'' fe''liga -es qo''shiladi: ''goes''.\nNatija: ''He goes to school by bus every morning''.", "answer": "He goes to school by bus every morning"}, {"title": "Inkor va so''roq shakl", "problem": "''She likes ice cream'' gapini inkor va so''roq shaklga aylantiring.", "step_by_step": "Inkor: ''She does not (doesn''t) like ice cream'' (asosiy fe''ldagi -s tushib qoladi).\nSo''roq: ''Does she like ice cream?''", "answer": "Doesn''t like / Does she like...?"}]'::jsonb, 'Qavslarni oching: ''They (not / play) football on rainy days, but Tom always (watch) matches on TV.''', '''They don''t play football on rainy days, but Tom always watches matches on TV.''', '[{"question": "He/She/It olmoshlaridan keyin Present Simple da qaysi yordamchi fe''l qo''llanadi?", "options": ["do", "does", "is", "have"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "3-shaxs birlikda inkor va so''roqda ''does'' (doesn''t) ishlatiladi."}, {"question": "''Water ... at 100 degrees Celsius'' gapidagi nuqtalar o''rniga qaysi fe''l mos keladi?", "options": ["boil", "boils", "boiling", "is boiling"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Tabiat qonuni va ilmiy haqiqat bo''lgani uchun Present Simple qo''llanadi: Water boils."}, {"question": "''Never'' so''zi qatnashgan gapda inkor ''not'' yuklamasi ishlatiladimi?", "options": ["Ha, doimo", "Yo''q, chunki ''never'' ning o''zi inkor ma''noga ega", "Faqat so''roq gapda", "Farqi yo''q"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Ingliz tilida bitta gapda ikkita inkor bo''lmaydi: ''I never drink coffee'' (not kerak emas)."}]'::jsonb, '["english", "grammar", "present simple", "verbs", "A1", "5-sinf"]'::jsonb, 25) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
